{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1495558-question-re-cod-etc-and-tradiontal-printings-pod-and-pdf","id":1495558,"title":"question re: 'CoD' etc. and tradiontal printings, pod, and pdf.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-10-25T06:33:51-07:00","id":1495558,"title":"question re: 'CoD' etc. and tradiontal printings, pod, and pdf.","content":"i'm curious, which 'chronicles of darkness,' 'vampire the requiem, ' werewolf the forsaken,' etc. books did not have a traditional print run and were only released as print on demand?<br /> and were there any that only released as pdf?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>they/them.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27123-littlewitchmaus","name":"littlewitchmaus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27123_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-25T12:16:33-07:00","id":1495591,"title":"","content":"If we just stick to the Onyx Path era (the late oWW and CCP periods make this a bit complicated):<br /> <br /> Only books that have had a Kickstarter/etc. campaign focused on those books (which mean books funded as stretch goals do not count) get traditional print runs That is, in name if not in purpose, what those crowdfunding efforts are actually about<b></b>: taking books that wouldn't have normally had the higher quality of a traditional print run because those are too risky for Onyx Path to do normally, and funding a print run.<br /> <br /> After that, as far as I can tell, everything above a certain page count or price as had a PoD option included; though some of those got collected into larger volumes (the 1e SAS modules might only be available as PDFs individually, but as they tended to be multi-part stories the full collected version would get PoD).<br /> <br /> I believe there's also a point where hard-cover PoD is not available for shorter books (or at least even if it was, the pricing would be too absurd to use) and some of the shorter PoD books are only available as soft cover PoD.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}